vFM Player - MIDI resources

SD folder: /vFM/midi

Copy midi.ini, banks and instruments from this repository folder. midi.ini selects the bank files; keep their names and hierarchy. Existing custom midi.ini files should be retained or merged. Use USB MIDI or Serial1 MIDI IN from the MIDI screen.

Files and instructions:
https://github.com/PanykSystem/vFMPlayer/tree/main/sdcard/midi

On a PC, use GitHub Code > Download ZIP, then copy the contents of sdcard into /vFM. Keep existing personal settings and recordings.
